      and ~81.5% free dust (baryon-blind)
         measured: phantom = 18.5%, free dust = 81.5%
         This partition is the theory's answer to 'what is dark matter made\n         of?': not one substance but one sector in two states, and the\n         split changes with epoch.

  the phantom share as a function of z (g_ext grows with redshift):
          z  g_ext/a_0   Om_ph/Om_b  phantom %
